# Temporary test and demo files
# These patterns MUST stay anchored with a leading "/" so they only match
# throwaway scripts at the repo root. The unanchored form (e.g. "test_*.py")
# matches at every depth and silently ignored real test files under
# Agent_Guru/**/tests/, keeping them out of version control.
/test_*.py
/demo_*.py
/verify_*.py
/check_*.py
/fix_*.py
/talk_to_*.py
